  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership Development Facility PDF19ET01 DSM International B.V.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The funding objective is to establish a partnership with a reputable local company in Ethiopia for the production of fortified nutritious food for children and mothers to combat malnutrition. The funds are used to hire on-the ground external staff to work on project operational, technical and commercial viability of the partnership, stakeholder management and preparation of any partnership agreements.</narrative>
  </description>
